    {
      "source": "Configuration class used for setting up <a href=\"RedisConnection.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnection</code></a> via <a href=\"RedisConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnectionFactory</code></a> using the provided\nMaster / Replica configuration to nodes know to not change address. Useful when connecting to\n<a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/documentation/elasticache/\">AWS ElastiCache with Read Replicas</a>.",
      "translation": "用于通过 <a href=\"RedisConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnectionFactory</code></a> 配置 <a href=\"RedisConnection.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnection</code></a> 的配置类，利用提供的主/从节点配置确保节点地址不会更改。此功能在连接至带有只读副本的<a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/documentation/elasticache/\">AWS ElastiCache</a>时非常有用。",
